{"ts":"2026-07-31T05:35:24.115Z","type":"finding","frontier":"rolling-restart-lifecycle-owner-rebind-recurrence-main","claim":"inherited from join-retry-resume-lifecycle-finalization: Fresh live stopped-state evidence shows all four joiners completed the same durable join session on attempt two and wrote ready leases, but each logged successful completion with lifecycleState=connecting; because the completed membership checkpoint was skipped, its resumed-infrastructure lifecycle catch-up never ran, FINALIZED ignored the failed CONNECTING-to-READY transition, and activated heartbeats reasserted status=joining, leaving the seed projection below five active nodes until timeout.","kind":"inherited-rulesout","evidence":"test-output/reports/movielens-lagrange-service-affinity-live-2026-07-20T02-22-27-350Z.report.json","rulesOut":"Do not treat this as only an AdminWsClient timeout or widen the 180000ms formation budget: seed admin polls repeatedly completed, durable rows and cache watermarks moved, and the canonical heartbeat fence directly derives JOINING publication from the non-READY local lifecycle.","verification":null,"regressionClassification":null,"scopePressureClassification":null}
{"ts":"2026-07-31T05:36:10.271Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"rolling-restart-lifecycle-owner-rebind-recurrence","consecutive":3,"metric":"priority"}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"rolling-restart-lifecycle-owner-rebind-recurrence","metric":"priority"}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"A durable-rejoin retry after a canonical-readiness failure retains one canonical lifecycle state-machine owner across NodeJoiningService and NodeService, preserves the same join session, reconstructs CONNECTING, DISCOVERING, and JOINING before retrying readiness, remains process-alive without replaying completed infrastructure or membership side effects, and the registered deterministic guard passes three consecutive runs.","title":null,"class":"product","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"reuse-canonical-lifecycle-owner","statement":"Reuse the existing lifecycle state machine and resumed-infrastructure catch-up owner; do not mutate lifecycle state directly, add a parallel state path, replay completed infrastructure or membership side effects, or synthesize READY."},{"id":"fail-closed-finalization","statement":"FINALIZED and steady-state background-writer activation must not succeed unless the canonical lifecycle owner confirms READY; an invalid transition must surface as a failure instead of logging completion or starting heartbeats."},{"id":"real-checkpoint-resume-seam","statement":"Deterministic evidence must use the real join coordinator and durable session store: attempt one completes membership and fails retryably in readiness, cleanup leaves STOPPED, attempt two resets to STARTING, skips completed infrastructure and membership checkpoints, reruns readiness, and reaches READY with one session identity and no duplicated membership side effects."},{"id":"heartbeat-publication-fence","statement":"The regression must prove steady-state writer activation observes local READY and cannot reassert a JOINING node row after the retry publishes the ready lease."},{"id":"negative-controls","statement":"Fresh joins, same-state READY idempotence, and terminal non-retryable cleanup must retain their existing behavior."},{"id":"production-owner-divergence-discriminator","statement":"Before changing source, extend the deterministic guard through the production durable-rejoin construction and cleanup sequence that leaves NodeService bound to a lifecycle owner different from the joining service at retry attempt two; prove which owner transition created the mismatch without assigning private lifecycle fields in the fixture."},{"id":"no-assert-or-budget-workaround","statement":"Do not remove or downgrade the canonical-owner assertion, accept an unknown owner, mutate lifecycle state directly, or change join/readiness timeout and retry budgets; resolve ownership through the canonical lifecycle-owner handoff."}],"verificationTemplates":[],"frontierIds":["rolling-restart-lifecycle-owner-rebind-recurrence-main"]}}
